# Normalize all text to LF in the repo. Fixture files are byte-pinned via
# SHA-256 in research/phase-2/REPRODUCE.md and re-checked by the phase-2
# validators, so line endings must not vary by machine or local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binaries: never apply line-ending or text conversion.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
